00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:37.388
So the first lesson of pairing
wines with food in general

00:01:37.388 --> 00:01:41.114
is if it grows together, it goes together.

00:01:41.114 --> 00:01:41.947
- Ooh!

00:01:41.947 --> 00:01:42.908
- So if, there you go!

00:01:42.908 --> 00:01:43.741
