00:02:25.536 --> 00:02:27.619
you're never gonna make it
through the entire tasting.

00:02:27.619 --> 00:02:28.890
- We don't waste wine in this house.

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:29.951
- (laughs) Okay.

00:02:29.951 --> 00:02:30.784
- Okay?

00:02:30.784 --> 00:02:33.534
