00:02:58.505 --> 00:02:59.830
Mm-hmm.

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:01.112
- I think it kinda works.

00:03:01.112 --> 00:03:02.726
- Mm-Hmm.

00:03:02.726 --> 00:03:04.643
- I actually like that.

00:03:05.506 --> 00:03:06.339
- Yup.

00:03:08.583 --> 00:03:11.699
When my kids aren't around is when I enjoy

00:03:11.699 --> 00:03:13.466
