00:03:28.427 --> 00:03:30.057
- I have some ice cream sandwiches.

00:03:30.057 --> 00:03:30.890
- Okay.

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:34.984
- This is the easiest dessert
to sneak if you have kids.

00:03:34.984 --> 00:03:35.817
- Okay.

00:03:35.817 --> 00:03:37.644
- Because you can just,
like, shove it in your shirt

00:03:37.644 --> 00:03:39.362
