00:03:39.362 --> 00:03:41.133
- I didn't put these in
my shirt, don't worry.

00:03:41.133 --> 00:03:41.966
- Okay.

00:03:41.966 --> 00:03:44.915
This is a dessert wine,
it's Moscato d'Asti.

00:03:44.915 --> 00:03:48.007
It's not very expensive,
it's a good value,

00:03:48.007 --> 00:03:50.499
